---
import { SITE_NAME } from "../consts";
---

<section id="mission" class="scroll-mt-24 border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">
      Why this matters
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
      <p>
        Advanced AI systems are being deployed faster than our understanding of
        how to make them safe, predictable, and accountable. This raises
        technical questions regarding how we ensure an autonomous system will
        behave as intended, as well as questions of policy, ethics, and
        institutional design: who decides what these systems should be permitted
        to do, and how?
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">{SITE_NAME}</span> is a
        student society at Western University dedicated to studying these
        questions in depth. We read, discuss, and write about the technical and
        societal risks posed by advanced AI, and we work to build a community at
        Western capable of engaging with this problem from more than one
        direction.
      </p>
      <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
        We believe this requires more than any single department or discipline
        can offer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
